 "notes": [
  "Polling days 31 January - 1 February 1988. The direct popular vote for president and the vote for presidential electors were separate ballots held at the same time; no candidate won more than half of the direct vote, so the electors chose the president.",
  "Electors: 301 in total, one from the Åland constituency (fixed by law) plus 300 apportioned among the other constituencies. Changes from 1982: Uusimaa 41 -> 43, Häme South 23 -> 22, Kymi 22 -> 21.",
  "Votes table (page 32) prints an extra column 'A,B,C,D yhteensä' (sum of SDP, SMP, Pro Koivisto and the Åland group, all supporting Mauno Koivisto); it is a subtotal and is not transcribed as a party.",
  "Party keys: smp = Suomen Maaseudun Puolue (FLP); pro_koivisto = the Pro Koivisto lists; aland = Ahvenanmaan valitsijayhdistys / Åländsk samling (column 'AHV. ÅLAND', the only list in the Åland constituency); ml = Keskustapuolue (KESK); liike88 = Liike-88 / Aktion -88, the lists supporting Kalevi Kivistö (abbreviated LIIKE-88 in the tables); deva = Demokraattinen Vaihtoehto (DEVA). No RKP or other party ran its own elector lists in this table.",
  "voters = persons who voted in the elector election (turnout table A, page 30); in every row it equals cast. The direct election has its own turnout column on page 30 (persons who voted in the direct election), which equals direct cast.",
  "Electors by party come from table 6 (number of persons elected by sex, party and constituency, page 96); seats = its total column. Demokraattinen Vaihtoehto won no electors.",
  "Direct vote (page 31, table B): candidate keys koivisto (Mauno Koivisto, nominated by SDP and SMP), vayrynen (Paavo Väyrynen, KESK), holkeri (Harri Holkeri, KOK), kivisto (Kalevi Kivistö, Liike-88), kajanoja (Jouko Kajanoja, DEVA). Direct 'registered' is the same electorate as the elector vote (page 30)."
 ],
